<title>HUNGARY: CESI index rallies, ends at 1,493.16 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index rallies, ends at 1,493.16 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index rallied 34.75 points or 2.38 percent to 1,493.16 points on Friday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
